# Declaration output for the two modules at the repo root. `dist/` and
# `dist-types/` covered every other project's emit, so nothing stopped these four
# files from being committed — and once committed, no build reproduced them and no
# gate compared them against their sources.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: the two hand-written declaration files that the build
# genuinely needs live inside `src/` directories, so this pattern cannot reach them.
/*.d.ts
/*.d.ts.map

